id synthesis in the inflammatory cells via inhibition of the COX-2 isoform of the arachidonic acid COX.[T28] For more information, refer to [ibuprofen].","neighbor_flag":"N","pubmed_ids":[22668799],"resource_name":"DrugBank","resource_version":"5.1","target_resource_id":"P07204"}],"rcsb_id":"1DX5_2"}